## Legend

| Signal | Meaning |
|---|---|
| ✅ | Shipped — review passed, security passed |
| 🟢 | On track — code complete or planning approved |
| 🟡 | In progress — research, requirements, or planning underway |
| 🚫 | Blocked — security review failed |
| ⚪ | Draft / unknown |
